    "name": "Isabella Martinez",
    "bio": "Isabella Martinez is a 23-year-old data analyst at the Val Verde County Planning Department in Del Rio, Texas, where she reviews local infrastructure reports and helps coordinate community projects. Raised in the area by her parents and two younger brothers, she stays close to family and often spends weekends at their home or attending local events. She enjoys hiking along the Rio Grande, reading historical fiction, cooking traditional Mexican dishes, and volunteering a few hours each month at the public library. Single and seeking a steady connection, Isabella values calm conversations, shared routines, and someone who appreciates both quiet evenings at home and occasional trips to nearby towns.",
